    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA McGee are delighted to present apartment 76 Millrace Road to the market.\r\n\r\nSet in a tranquil and scenic location just 6km from Dublin City Centre, this one bedroom apartment offers the perfect balance of peaceful living and urban convenience. Ideally positioned beside the Phoenix Park, residents can enjoy vast green spaces, walking trails, and a wide range of outdoor and sporting activities right on their doorstep.\r\n\r\nLocated within the highly sought-after Phoenix Park Racecourse development, this property benefits from a well-established community featuring a mix of apartments, duplexes, and family homes. The property briefly comprises of an entrance hallway, kitchen, open plan living/dining room which opens out to a balcony, a spacious double bedroom and main bathroom.\r\n\r\nCastleknock Village is just a short stroll away, offering an ever-growing selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, and bars. Excellent transport links include nearby access to the N3, M3, and M50, while both Ashtown Railway Station and Navan Road Parkway Railway Station are within a five-minute walk, providing quick and easy access to the city centre.\r\n\r\nResidents also benefit from a range of on-site amenities, including a Londis convenience store, pharmacy, large communal green spaces, and playgrounds. Combining a prime location and excellent amenities, this apartment on Millrace Road is a standout opportunity in one of Dublin’s most desirable residential areas."
      },
